msgstr "電波の状態"

msgid "The SIM message storage is (almost) full. New messages cannot be received until some are deleted."
msgstr "SIM の SMS 保存領域が（ほぼ）いっぱいです。削除するまで新しい SMS を受信できません。"

msgid "The message must be 1 to 70 characters."
msgstr "本文は 1〜70 文字で入力してください。"

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "宛先"

